cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GitGrounded"
abstract: >-
  GitGrounded tests an AI app before and after a prompt or model change and
  tells you whether the change made it worse. It supports two modes: git
  mode (diffs two git branches of a local app, generates targeted
  regression tests from the diff, and judges old vs new answers) and
  endpoint mode (tests any live HTTP API against its own stored version
  history).
authors:
